      "content": "wait what? what do you mean by \"goblin's lair\" and \"goblin-infested cave\"? i'm just trying to fix a production outage. can you just stick to the technical steps? please finish the point about the image pull issues and give me specific commands to run to check the resource usage and the probe status.",
